  "size": 5,
  "ok": true,
  "answer": "[1] slot-1\nA hash chain is a sequence of data blocks where each block contains the cryptographic hash of the previous block, creating a linked structure that ensures data integrity and detects tampering.\n\n[2] slot-2\nA hash chain is a sequence of data blocks where each block contains the cryptographic hash of the previous block, creating a tamper-evident link that ensures data integrity.\n\n[3] slot-3\nA hash chain is a sequence of data blocks where each block contains the cryptographic hash of the previous block, creating a tamper-evident link that ensures the integrity of the entire chain.\n\n[4] slot-4\nA hash chain is a sequence of data blocks where each block contains the cryptographic hash of the previous block, creating a tamper-evident link that ensures the integrity of the entire chain.\n\n[5] slot-5\nA hash chain is a sequence of data blocks where each block contains the cryptographic hash of the previous block, creating a tamper-evident link that ensures the integrity of the entire chain.",
